WEBVTT

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.639
Every autumn, when the fog rolled in from the north, old Maren climbed the cliff

00:00:08.639 --> 00:00:10.252
path to light the lamp.

00:00:10.352 --> 00:00:14.062
But this year the fog did not roll. It surged.

00:00:14.412 --> 00:00:18.017
And somewhere inside it, something was coming home.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.710
She struck the match.
